things working in their favor, it was recently

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:12.290
reported that U.S. Postmaster General Louis
Dejoy has awarded a massive contract.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.260
The post office has awarded a massive contract.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:19.030
He swears he wasn't involved in the process,
but they have awarded a massive contract to

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.640
a company called XPO Logistics.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:27.910
And those who have you who have been following
excuse me, Louis Dejoy story for the past

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:32.279
year, I'm sure that company name certainly
rings a bell, right.

00:00:32.279 --> 00:00:39.360
Because XPO Logistics happens to be the company
that Louis Dejoy up until October held a massive

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:46.320
financial interest in, but he divested from
that company in October.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:51.850
Kind of Citizens for Responsibility and Ethics
