00:01:24.069 --> 00:01:28.429
So the big question everybody has, of course,
is why is Louis Dejoy still the postmaster

00:01:28.429 --> 00:01:30.959
general of the United States?

00:01:30.959 --> 00:01:34.950
And the answer is because, man, the post office
infrastructure is set up.

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:41.969
Weird that that is honestly the best way I
can describe it going through.

00:01:41.969 --> 00:01:45.670
And I'm not sure if David has explained this,
but I'm going to go ahead and explain it in

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:48.759
a really slimmed down version here.

00:01:48.759 --> 00:01:54.960
But to just sum it up, incredibly hard to
remove a postmaster general.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.270
Here's what's happening.

00:01:56.270 --> 00:01:58.729
Biden cannot fire Louis Dejoy.

00:01:58.729 --> 00:02:01.169
He is powerless to stop Dejoy.

00:02:01.169 --> 00:02:07.749
But when he can do is he can appoint new members
to the board of governors, of which he's already

00:02:07.749 --> 00:02:08.749
nominated.

00:02:08.749 --> 00:02:10.560
Three, they have not been approved.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:17.519
And then the board of governors are the ones
who get to vote to oust the postmaster general.

00:02:17.519 --> 00:02:22.700
Here's a problem, though, there's three vacancies,
Biden's nominated people for those, and if

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:29.650
and when they get approved, Democrats will
have the majority on that board of governors.

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:32.879
So you would think at that point that joyes
history, right?

00:02:32.879 --> 00:02:40.879
Nope, because two of the Democrats on that
board of governors were appointed by Trump.

00:02:40.879 --> 00:02:44.780
And those same two Democrats actually voted
in favor.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.390
Of this New Deal.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:51.709
So they're OK with it, they're OK with Dejoy.

00:02:51.709 --> 00:02:55.909
So Biden can get his people there.

00:02:55.909 --> 00:02:59.890
Democrats will have the majority, but they
still.

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:03.730
Probably not going to remove him at that point,
so then what's the remedy?

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.950
Well, I'm glad you asked.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:11.560
The remedy is Biden can fire members of the
governor's board with cause.

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:17.620
Now, that little statement with cause or four
calls, I think is how it's phrased.

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:20.030
Very difficult.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:25.890
Because calls can mean anything and cause
can mean nothing.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:31.530
And cause can be a very specific incident,
depending on which court is looking at it,

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:34.569
and that's what's so worrisome here.

00:03:34.569 --> 00:03:38.879
Firing these individuals for not removing
Louis Dejoy for a very obvious conflict of

00:03:38.879 --> 00:03:43.610
