00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.859
Depending on which court hears this case.

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:49.650
Now, does it have to go before court?

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:51.790
Absolutely not.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:55.689
But if these individuals sue alleging that
there is no cause it would go in front of

00:03:55.689 --> 00:04:00.299
a court and the experts have pretty much agreed
that's what would happen if BIID if Biden

00:04:00.299 --> 00:04:04.370
